/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"Copilot Pull Request Reviewer","description":"","external_url":"https://github.com/features/copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","created_at":"2024-07-16T15:38:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T15:50:53Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","administration":"read","checks":"read","contents":"read","copilot_requests":"write","issues":"read","members":"read","metadata":"read","packages":"read","pull_requests":"write"},"events":[]}},{"id":3857372850,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOEFLz887l6tay","user":{"login":"Copilot","id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nAdds nominative SSH access support by introducing `localpart:*@<domain>` handling in policy/v2 SSH rules, aligning headscale’s compiled SSH policy output more closely with Tailscale SaaS behavior and expanding the SSH-policy compatibility test coverage.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add `SSHUser` helpers to detect/parse `localpart:*@<domain>` and update SSH policy validation accordingly.\n- Update SSH policy compilation to emit per-user `tailcfg.SSHRule` entries (and handle `autogroup:self` filtering, `user:*@domain` sources, and `acceptEnv` passthrough).\n- Add/extend unit + integration + data-driven compatibility tests and captured SSH expected-results fixtures.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 48 out of 48 changed files in this pull request and generated no comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| integration/ssh_test.go | Adds helpers to SSH as an arbitrary user and introduces an OIDC-based integration test for `localpart` behavior. |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/types.go | Introduces `localpart` parsing/validation, `user:*@domain` alias support, and adds `acceptEnv` to SSH rules. |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/types_test.go | Adds policy unmarshal tests and unit tests covering `localpart` parsing and `SSHUsers` helpers. |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/filter.go | Updates SSH policy compilation to generate per-user rules for `localpart` and handle new SSH rule fields/ordering. |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/filter_test.go | Updates/extends compilation tests to reflect new rule shapes (root deny defaults, localpart interleaving, principals grouping). |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/tailscale_ssh_data_compat_test.go | Adds a data-driven test runner for captured Tailscale SSH policy outputs. |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/testdata/ssh_results/*.json | Adds captured expected SSH policy outputs (fixtures) used by the data-driven compat tests. |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/policy_test.go | Extends policy tests to cover `localpart` mapping behavior in the legacy policy test suite. |\r\n| CHANGELOG.md | Documents breaking/behavior changes around SSH compilation semantics. |\r\n| .github/workflows/test-integration.yaml | Ensures the new `TestSSHLocalpart` integration test is executed in CI. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Comments suppressed due to low confidence (1)</summary>\n\n**hscontrol/policy/v2/filter.go:370**\n* `compileSSHPolicy` no longer has a `//nolint:gocyclo` suppression even though this repo enables `gocyclo` via golangci-lint. Given the function's size/branching, this is likely to trip the cyclomatic-complexity check and fail CI. Either refactor to reduce complexity below the linter threshold, or re-add a scoped `//nolint:gocyclo` with a brief justification (consistent with other complex functions in the codebase).\n```\nfunc (pol *Policy) compileSSHPolicy(\n\tbaseURL string,\n\tusers types.Users,\n\tnode types.NodeView,\n\tnodes views.Slice[types.NodeView],\n) (*tailcfg.SSHPolicy, error) {\n```\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/juanfont/headscale/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","commit_id":"b732487acad2f8d598941d23de68ae61851d3644","state":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3091#pullrequestreview-3857372850","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3091","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3091#pullrequestreview-3857372850"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3091"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-25T22:38:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T22:38:00Z","author_association":"NONE","event":"reviewed"},{"id":23092057072,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887r2hbXzwAAAAVgZNPw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/23092057072","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"adffba192bc3fa5eb0d95af566285eba2a6479e5","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/adffba192bc3fa5eb0d95af566285eba2a6479e5","created_at":"2026-02-26T06:21:33Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"597cd893d86d35a182a7caffcffacba8ad4e1a27","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDU5N2NkODkzZDg2ZDM1YTE4MmE3Y2FmZmNmZmFjYmE4YWQ0ZTFhMjc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/597cd893d86d35a182a7caffcffacba8ad4e1a27","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/597cd893d86d35a182a7caffcffacba8ad4e1a27","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-24T19:39:52Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-27T19:43:38Z"},"tree":{"sha":"a3e84968b78bd105dc74fd05902a0f77e4732846","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/a3e84968b78bd105dc74fd05902a0f77e4732846"},"message":"policy/v2: add localpart:*@domain SSH user compilation\n\nAdd support for localpart:*@<domain> entries in SSH policy users.\nWhen a user SSHes into a target, their email local-part becomes the\nOS username (e.g. alice@example.com → OS user alice).\n\nType system (types.go):\n- SSHUser.IsLocalpart() and ParseLocalpart() for validation\n- SSHUsers.LocalpartEntries(), NormalUsers(), ContainsLocalpart()\n- Enforces format: localpart:*@<domain> (wildcard-only)\n- UserWildcard.Resolve for user:*@domain SSH source aliases\n- acceptEnv passthrough for SSH rules\n\nCompilation (filter.go):\n- resolveLocalparts: pure function mapping users to local-parts\n  by email domain. No node walking, easy to test.\n- groupSourcesByUser: single walk producing per-user principals\n  with sorted user IDs, and tagged principals separately.\n- ipSetToPrincipals: shared helper replacing 6 inline copies.\n- selfPrincipalsForNode: self-access using pre-computed byUser.\n\nThe approach separates data gathering from rule assembly. Localpart\nrules are interleaved per source user to match Tailscale SaaS\nfirst-match-wins ordering.\n\nUpdates #3049","parents":[{"sha":"84adda226be25cc9e3240d39ef5b56627ade6a47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/84adda226be25cc9e3240d39ef5b56627ade6a47","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/84adda226be25cc9e3240d39ef5b56627ade6a47"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"6c43542cfd45b6f218d09b6040af846fc6622843","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDZjNDM1NDJjZmQ0NWI2ZjIxOGQwOWI2MDQwYWY4NDZmYzY2MjI4NDM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/6c43542cfd45b6f218d09b6040af846fc6622843","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/6c43542cfd45b6f218d09b6040af846fc6622843","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-24T19:40:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-27T19:43:38Z"},"tree":{"sha":"95763a192a206944d40d76e26e8125a047a25b5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/95763a192a206944d40d76e26e8125a047a25b5b"},"message":"policy/v2: add SSH compatibility testdata from Tailscale SaaS\n\nAdd 39 test fixtures captured from Tailscale SaaS API responses\nto validate SSH policy compilation parity. Each JSON file contains\nthe SSH policy section and expected compiled SSHRule arrays for 5\ntest nodes (3 user-owned, 2 tagged).\n\nTest series: SSH-A (basic), SSH-B (specific sources), SSH-C\n(destination combos), SSH-D (localpart), SSH-E (edge cases),\nSSH-F (multi-rule), SSH-G (acceptEnv).\n\nThe data-driven TestSSHDataCompat harness uses cmp.Diff with\nprincipal order tolerance but strict rule ordering (first-match-wins\nsemantics require exact order).\n\nUpdates #3049","parents":[{"sha":"597cd893d86d35a182a7caffcffacba8ad4e1a27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/597cd893d86d35a182a7caffcffacba8ad4e1a27","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/597cd893d86d35a182a7caffcffacba8ad4e1a27"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":23145344268,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887r2hbXzwAAAAVjke0M","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/23145344268","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https